{# What the harness sends to the model when a new session gets its first prompt: the context it could load, then the
   prompt. Only the headings are this template's; each context line is what Meko returned, word for word. Who wrote
   each is shown beside the input on the page, not sent: the model needs the facts, not their provenance. Without a
   store, a new session has nothing to load. #}
You are {{ harness }}, an AI assistant working on this project.

{% if facts %}
Context (loaded from Meko before the prompt):
{% for fact in facts %}
- {{ fact.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Context:
(none: a new session starts empty)
{% endif %}

Prompt:
{{ prompt }}
